  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "The unusual leaves are divided into small long, narrow, sharply pointed lobes which are held like an upside-down T. The lobes have Acer untoothed rolled margins to almost form tubes. The upper leaf surface is a deep rich green and shallow the lower surface a soft gray-blue, so the rolledtoothed. up margins create a two-tone effect. Fall colors hornbeamlike are a rich gold and red. 'Naruto' forms a tall curious dense sturdy plant up to 13 ft. (4 m) tall. vein"
